<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h3>The 25-man Heroic version (Item Level 277) of the Tier 10 helm is individually the BiS option for Phase 4 just due to its stat allocation, making it even better once the 4-piece bonus is taken into account. The next best option individually is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50713/geistlords-punishment-sack">
