<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Feral Druid DPS Phase 2</h3>Similar to the helm slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51299/sanctified-lasherweave-shoulderpads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_111.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lasherweave Shoulderpads</span></a> are individually best in slot from their raw stats alone, making them an obvious choice when optimizing for the 4-piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-253/sanctified-lasherweave-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lasherweave Battlegear</span></a> set bonus in full BiS setups. However, as alluded to in the Emblem section above, these shoulders are a very minor upgrade over the 10-man off-piece option, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51830/skinned-whelp-shoulders">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_112.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skinned Whelp Shoulders</span></a>. As a result, since Heroic <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=52028/vanquishers-mark-of-sanctification">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_judgementsofthejust.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vanquisher's Mark of Sanctification</span></a> tokens will be highly contested for quite a while, it is recommended to deprioritize the shoulder slot when initially building a 4pT10 configuration, and opt for off-piece alternatives instead until later in the phase.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=61117/masters-inscription-of-the-axe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Master's Inscription of the Axe</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=773/inscription">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a>.<br/>If you are not a Scribe, then the best alternative shoulder enchant is <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50335/greater-inscription-of-the-axe">
