<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h3>In a vacuum, the cloak rewards from completing <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="achievement" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/achievement=3819/a-tribute-to-insanity-25-player">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">A Tribute to Insanity (25 player)</span></a> remain the highest DPS option even in Phase 4 due to their high Armor Penetration allocation. However, once you obtain both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50363/deathbringers-will">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deathbringer's Will</span></a> <i>and</i> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54590/sharpened-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sharpened Twilight Scale</span></a>, you will no longer be able to efficiently accommodate the Armor Penetration Rating on the Tribute cloak while staying below the hard cap, so <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50653/shadowvault-slayers-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncloak.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowvault Slayer's Cloak</span></a> becomes the optimal choice in full BiS setups.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55777/swordguard-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=197/tailoring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>.<br/>If you are not a Tailor, then the best alternative cloak enchants are <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55002/flexweave-underlay">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flexweave Underlay</span></a> for Engineers and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60663/enchant-cloak-major-agility">
