<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h3>The wrist slot mirrors the cloak slot after the release of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50670/toskks-maximized-wristguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Toskk's Maximized Wristguards</span></a> from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> remain the strongest option in isolation, but players who are lucky enough to obtain both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50363/deathbringers-will">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deathbringer's Will</span></a> <i>and</i> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54590/sharpened-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sharpened Twilight Scale</span></a> will optimally wear <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54580/umbrage-armbands">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbrage Armbands</span></a> instead, since the new bracers serve as an efficient way to drop Armor Penetration in your gear set in order to stay below the stat's hard cap of 1399 Rating.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57683/fur-lining-attack-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Attack Power</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>.<br/>If you are not a Leatherworker, then the best alternative bracer enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44575/enchant-bracers-greater-assault">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Greater Assault</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
