<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h3>Phase 4 itemization in the leg slot follows the same pattern as the helm and shoulder slots, but even further amplified: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51297/sanctified-lasherweave-legguards">
