<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Idols for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-feral-druid-dps-phase-4">Weapons for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h4>The top DPS weapon for cats in Phase 4 will be the prestigious 284 Item Level polearm off <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36597/the-lich-king">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Lich King</span></a> himself on 25-man Heroic difficulty: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50735/oathbinder-charge-of-the-ranger-general">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_staff_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Oathbinder, Charge of the Ranger-General</span></a>. Weapon upgrades have always been the most significant contributors to DPS increases each phase for Ferals in WotLK, but this weapon in particular is an extreme example of that due to its inflated Item Level and its high Armor Penetration allocation. Simulation results indicate that Heroic Oathbinder will provide a massive 547 DPS upgrade over the next best weapon option from 25-man ICC (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50695/distant-land">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_107.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Distant Land</span></a>), a 707 DPS upgrade over the best 10-man option (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51945/tainted-twig-of-nordrassil">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tainted Twig of Nordrassil</span></a>), and a nearly 1400 DPS upgrade over Phase 3 BiS weapons!<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Berserking</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=42974/enchant-weapon-executioner">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Executioner</span></a>
<br/>As mentioned earlier in this guide when describing the 10-man BiS configuration, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=42974/enchant-weapon-executioner">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Executioner</span></a> will provide higher DPS than <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Berserking</span></a> at intermediate ICC gear levels, when you have already dropped <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45931/mjolnir-runestone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rune_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mjolnir Runestone</span></a> and are stacking Armor Penetration on your gear, but are still below the "Executioner soft cap" of 1279 Rating.<div class="pad"></div>
