<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="idols-for-feral-druid-dps-phase-4">Idols for Feral Druid DPS Phase 4</h4>Just like the prior WotLK content phases, Phase 4 introduces a new Idol option for Feral Druids: the <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> reward <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50456/idol-of-the-crying-moon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_natureguardian.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Crying Moon</span></a>. While the new Idol is technically BiS on extended single target fights, it should be thought of as a sidegrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a> from Phase 3, and should be your lowest priority <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> purchase if you are a pure DPS player. The reason for this is the long ramp-up time for the Idol's <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=71175/agile">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_druid_feralchargecat.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Agile</span></a> buff, which only surpasses the old <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67355/agile">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_druid_feralchargecat.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Agile</span></a> buff in power after all 5 stacks have been accumulated. Maxing out <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=71175/agile">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_druid_feralchargecat.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Agile</span></a> stacks typically takes around 20 seconds from the start of a boss pull, which also means you will have a weaker Agility buff during your <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=50334/berserk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_berserk.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Berserk</span></a> opener. As a result, simulation comparisons indicate that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50456/idol-of-the-crying-moon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_natureguardian.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Crying Moon</span></a> will only provide higher overall DPS than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47668/idol-of-mutilation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of Mutilation</span></a> for fight lengths above 164 seconds in length.<div class="pad"></div>
